{"seq":2,"slug":"generative-verifiers","title":"生成式验证器与 LLM-as-Judge 的区别","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/rlvr-verifiable-reward-training/domain-expansion/generative-verifiers","wordCount":1932,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"生成式验证器与-llm-as-judge-的区别\">生成式验证器与 LLM-as-Judge 的区别</h1><p>当任务走完<a href=\"../paradigm/spectrum-of-verifiability\">可验证性谱系</a>仍找不到程序化真值时，下一个可用的判定者就是另一个大模型。「用模型验证模型」这个想法下其实住着两个经常被混为一谈的物种：一个是让模型直接给分或二选一的 LLM-as-Judge，一个是让模型先推理再下结论的生成式验证器（Generative Verifier）。两者相差的不是工程细节，而是「判断发生在推理之前还是之后」——这决定了它们各自的偏差结构、成本曲线与被黑客攻击的方式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>当任务找不到程序化真值时，下一个可用的判定者是另一个大模型。但「用模型验证模型」下住着两个常被混为一谈的物种，区分它们的钥匙是判断发生在推理之前还是之后：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>LLM-as-Judge</strong>：单次前向直接输出分数或胜负标签，本质是条件概率查询，快而便宜但带着位置、长度、自我偏好等偏差。</li>\n<li><strong>生成式验证器（GenRM）</strong>：先生成一段核查推理链，再输出判定 token 并取其概率作软评分，贵一个数量级却可解释、可集成。</li>\n<li><strong>可靠性边界</strong>：采样集成能压随机误差（方差随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 下降），但压不掉系统偏差——多采样治抖动不治偏见。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>关键误解是把评审分数当成人类判断的无偏代理。它只是一个有偏样本；一旦接入 RL 当奖励源，评审就从测量工具变成被优化的对象，防护成本陡增。</p>\n<h2 id=\"判别式打分与生成式审查\">判别式打分与生成式审查</h2><p>LLM-as-Judge 是直觉做法的直译：把候选回答喂给一个强模型，提示词里要求它输出分数或在成对比较中指认胜者，AlpacaEval 与各类 Arena 风格评测都是这一路线的代表。它的本质是条件概率查询——在几乎不给出思考预算的情况下，让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>J</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>prompt</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J_\\phi(\\text{prompt}, y)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0962em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϕ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">prompt</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 直接吐出结论。</p>\n<p>生成式验证器（GenRM）把这个过程倒过来。Google DeepMind 的生成式验证器研究（arXiv:2408.15240）把验证重新表述为下一 token 预测：给定问题与候选解答，模型先生成一段审查链——逐步核对推理是否成立——最后输出 <code>是</code> 或 <code>否</code> 的判定 token，取该 token 的概率作为软评分：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>correct</mtext><mo>∣</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mtext>是</mtext></msub><mo>∣</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\text{correct} \\mid q, y) = P_\\theta(v_{\\text{是}} \\mid q,\\ y,\\ c_{1:n})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">correct</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">是</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">:</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{1:n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">:</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是模型自己生成的核查推理。这与测试时计算的逻辑同构：解一道题需要思考，判断一个答案同样需要思考；跳过思考直接打分，等于要求模型在单次前向传播里完成一次本该展开的计算。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>LLM-as-Judge</th>\n<th>生成式验证器</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>判定时机</td>\n<td>单次前向，无显式推理</td>\n<td>先生成核查链再判定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输出</td>\n<td>分数 / 胜负标签</td>\n<td>判定 token 及其概率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主要偏差</td>\n<td>位置、长度、自我偏好</td>\n<td>过度自信、核查链本身的错误</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本</td>\n<td>低（一次调用）</td>\n<td>高（每候选一段推理）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可提升性</td>\n<td>换更强裁判、改提示词</td>\n<td>加采样自一致性、延长核查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型用途</td>\n<td>开放对话评测、偏好数据标注</td>\n<td>数学代码验证、拒绝采样</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"偏差图谱与集成的不对称修补\">偏差图谱与集成的不对称修补</h2><p>两类验证器的缺陷清单几乎不重叠。评审式打分的经典偏差有四类：<strong>位置偏差</strong>——成对比较中先出现的回答占优，标准对策是交换顺序各评一次取一致；<strong>长度偏差</strong>——冗长回答系统性得分更高；<strong>自我偏好</strong>——裁判模型偏爱与自己风格相近的输出，导致用强模型评弱模型时打分失真；<strong>奉承敏感性</strong>——回答中迎合性的措辞能左右判定。这些偏差是提示词与模型先验的函数，换裁判、换顺序只能挪动它们的位置。</p>\n<p>生成式验证器的麻烦则集中在核查链质量本身：它会理直气壮地验证通过一个错误的证明，也会因为自己解不出题而误杀正确的答案。对这类随机性错误，采样集成有效——同一候选独立采样 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 条核查链做多数投票：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>K</mi></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>K</mi></munderover><msub><mi>J</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>K</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Var}\\!\\left[\\frac{1}{K}\\sum_{k=1}^{K} J_k(y)\\right] = \\frac{\\sigma^2}{K}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1304em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Var</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0962em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">]</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1771em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>方差随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 下降，但注意集成修补的边界：若核查链存在系统偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>（比如总对某类论证过度宽容），期望误差里的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>J</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>J</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{E}[\\hat J - J^{*}] = b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1968em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 一个也不会少。多采样治抖动不治偏见，这是所有「用更多算力堆验证精度」方案共同的数学天花板。</p>\n<p>成本压力因此催生了级联调度：便宜的单次评审先做粗筛，低置信度或高利害的候选才升级到生成式核查链，仍不确定的极小部分交给人工。级联的关键参数是升级阈值的校准——模型口头报告的置信度普遍过度自信，需要用留出集重新拟合判定概率才能当调度信号用。另一条实用纪律是让两类评审互查：生成式验证器抽查评审式打分的裁决，暴露系统性偏差；后者反过来给前者的核查链挑逻辑漏洞。交叉审计的成本远低于各自堆采样数。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    Q[&quot;需要给回答判定质量&quot;] --&gt; V{&quot;存在程序化真值？&quot;}&#10;    V --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| H[&quot;硬验证器&lt;br/&gt;L1-L3 档位优先&quot;]&#10;    V --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| G{&quot;错误代价高吗？&lt;br/&gt;需要可解释依据？&quot;}&#10;    G --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| GV[&quot;生成式验证器&lt;br/&gt;核查链 + 多数投票&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| J[&quot;LLM-as-Judge&lt;br/&gt;便宜快速批量筛&quot;]&#10;    GV --&gt; ESC{&quot;置信度低？&quot;}&#10;    J --&gt; ESC&#10;    ESC --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| HU[&quot;升级人工抽审&lt;br/&gt;回流标注数据&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    Q[\"需要给回答判定质量\"] --&gt; V{\"存在程序化真值？\"}\n    V --&gt;|\"是\"| H[\"硬验证器&lt;br/&gt;L1-L3 档位优先\"]\n    V --&gt;|\"否\"| G{\"错误代价高吗？&lt;br/&gt;需要可解释依据？\"}\n    G --&gt;|\"是\"| GV[\"生成式验证器&lt;br/&gt;核查链 + 多数投票\"]\n    G --&gt;|\"否\"| J[\"LLM-as-Judge&lt;br/&gt;便宜快速批量筛\"]\n    GV --&gt; ESC{\"置信度低？\"}\n    J --&gt; ESC\n    ESC --&gt;|\"是\"| HU[\"升级人工抽审&lt;br/&gt;回流标注数据\"]</pre><h2 id=\"当评审成为强化学习的奖励源\">当评审成为强化学习的奖励源</h2><p>评审做离线评测时，偏差只是测量误差；一旦接入 RL 循环当奖励信号，性质就完全变了——策略会以训练步为单位持续寻找并开采评审的一切弱点。奉承文本、格式讨好、针对裁判提示词的措辞投机，都会从偶发噪音变成被梯度放大的主流策略（机制见<a href=\"../technical-stack/reward-hacking-in-rlvr\">奖励黑客</a>）。因此评审入环必须配三重防护：裁判轮换（多个异构裁判交叉打分）、提示词扰动（定期微调评判框架防过拟合特定措辞）、对抗审计（专门训一个「骗过裁判」的红队模型来暴露漏洞）。即便如此，评审入环的 RL 至今没有产出过硬验证器域那种干净的能力跃升——这个事实本身就是对风险的最诚实注脚。</p>\n<h2 id=\"在版图上的位置\">在版图上的位置</h2><p>回到整个 hub 的坐标系：生成式验证器不是硬验证器的替代品，而是它在模糊地带的延伸臂。<a href=\"beyond-math-code\">哪些领域可以 RLVR 化</a>篇的三道闸门筛掉的领域，正是它的主战场；它与过程奖励模型的关系也值得点破——GenRM 天然可以逐步骤调用充当 PRM，省去了蒙特卡洛 rollout 标注（见<a href=\"../technical-stack/verifier-design\">验证器设计模式</a>），代价是把 PRM 的黑客风险原样继承过来。选型口诀：有真值用真值，没真值用推理型评审，评审也不可靠时回到人，且永远记住评审分数只是人类判断的有偏样本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>LLM-as-Judge 直接打分，快而便宜但带着位置、长度与自我偏好；生成式验证器先推理后判定，贵一个数量级却换来可解释与可集成的判定质量。采样投票能压随机误差，压不掉系统偏差。评审一旦接入 RL 当奖励，就从测量工具变成被优化的对象，防护成本陡增——能用程序化真值的场景永远不要退而求其次。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"生成式验证器与 LLM-as-Judge 的区别","id":"生成式验证器与-llm-as-judge-的区别"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"判别式打分与生成式审查","id":"判别式打分与生成式审查"},{"level":2,"text":"偏差图谱与集成的不对称修补","id":"偏差图谱与集成的不对称修补"},{"level":2,"text":"当评审成为强化学习的奖励源","id":"当评审成为强化学习的奖励源"},{"level":2,"text":"在版图上的位置","id":"在版图上的位置"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"哪些领域可以 RLVR 化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/rlvr-verifiable-reward-training/domain-expansion/beyond-math-code"},"next":{"title":"自博弈与自动出题课程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/rlvr-verifiable-reward-training/domain-expansion/self-play-curricula"}}